	'rx_note' => 'Site visit free. Ingredients, team and cleaning included. Prices before tax.',
	'rates_c1_h' => 'What are our tiered per-lunch service rates?',
	'rates_c1_b' => 'Our pricing structure is organized into clear volume tiers that reflect kitchen economies of scale. Small lunchrooms serving 30 to 80 lunches daily are priced at $9.20 per lunch. Standard lunchrooms preparing 81 to 250 lunches daily operate at $8.40 per lunch. Large facilities serving 251 to 600 lunches per day are billed at $7.60 per lunch. Workplaces requiring a second-shift dining window add a supplemental $1.10 per lunch. Insulated night-shift hot boxes are available at $6.80 per box, and our full five-day trial week is offered at a flat $2,400.',
	'rates_c2_h' => 'What operational expenses are included in the per-lunch price?',
	'rates_c2_b' => 'Every per-lunch rate covers the complete cost of daily cafeteria operations without hidden facility management fees. All raw food ingredients, recipe development, and seasonal produce purchasing managed by Daniel Roth are included in the per-meal rate. On-site kitchen labor, payroll, uniforms, and insurance adhering to our one-to-forty staffing ratio are fully covered. Daily kitchen hygiene, post-service dining room cleaning, chemical sanitizers, and waste handling are also built into the cost. Initial site visits in Week 1 are provided free of charge, and all listed prices apply before applicable local sales tax.',
	'rates_c3_h' => 'How is the monthly invoice calculated?',
	'rates_c3_b' => 'Monthly billing is straightforward and calculated from actual meal tallies recorded at the kitchen pass each business day. At the end of the billing cycle, total daytime lunches served are multiplied by your facility\'s volume tier rate—$9.20, $8.40, or $7.60 per meal. Any second-shift meals served are billed with the $1.10 per-lunch addition, while night-shift hot boxes are itemized separately at $6.80 each. Invoices detail daily dining volume counts and shift breakdowns, providing accounting departments with transparent verification. Client manager Priya Raman reviews monthly statements with your administrative team to maintain financial accuracy.',
