	'contact_c1_h' => 'How can you get in touch with our central office?',
	'contact_c1_b' => 'Our headquarters is located at 14 Mill Quay, Eastmere. Our administrative office is open Monday through Friday from 8:30 to 17:30, while our client service window runs daily from 11:30 to 13:30. You can reach our team by telephone at +1 (555) 014-0162 during standard business hours. If you prefer electronic communication, write to us directly at hello@mahorafoods.example. Client manager Priya Raman and our administrative staff review all inquiries promptly and respond within one business day to discuss workplace dining needs and site visit availability.',
	'contact_c2_h' => 'What information should you include in your initial inquiry?',
	'contact_c2_b' => 'When reaching out to Mahora Foods for the first time, providing a few key operational details helps us prepare a meaningful initial assessment. Please share your workplace type—whether an office, manufacturing factory, academic campus, or distribution depot—along with your physical location within our four regional districts. It is also helpful to include your estimated daily meal count, typical employee lunch hours, whether you operate multiple shifts, and a brief overview of your current kitchen, kitchenette, or cafeteria space. This context allows our team to prepare relevant information before our first conversation.',
	'contact_c3_h' => 'What happens after you submit your inquiry?',
	'contact_c3_b' => 'Once we receive your message, Priya Raman will contact your office to arrange an introductory telephone call and schedule a complimentary Week 1 site inspection. During this visit, our operations team examines your dining area, utility infrastructure, and service flow to verify facility capabilities. Following the visit, we provide a transparent written proposal detailing your volume tier rate, staffing plan based on our 1:40 ratio, and proposed four-week menu cycle. There is no financial obligation for this initial assessment, allowing your management team to evaluate our service structure thoroughly.',
	'ctc_btn' => 'Email us',
	'contact_title' => 'Contact',
	'contact_s' => 'let\'s talk',
	'contact_l' => 'Get in touch with Mahora Foods to discuss dining operations for your workplace. Our central office team is available Monday through Friday to answer questions and schedule an initial site visit.',
	'privacy_c1_h' => 'What business information do we collect and maintain?',
	'privacy_c1_b' => 'We collect basic contact and organizational information necessary to administer lunchroom contracts and respond to business inquiries. This includes business names, facility addresses, contact telephone numbers, email addresses, and designated billing contact details submitted when requesting proposals or managing active agreements. For client workplaces, we also record headcount estimates, service shift schedules, and operational facility notes required to plan kitchen staffing and food purchasing. We collect this data solely to conduct legitimate commercial business operations and do not share, sell, or rent client information to outside commercial entities.',
	'privacy_c2_h' => 'How do we handle dietary notifications and allergy records?',
	'privacy_c2_b' => 'In the course of managing workplace lunchrooms, client organizations may communicate specific dietary preferences, food allergies, or medical restrictions on behalf of their employees. We treat this information strictly as confidential operational guidance. Dietary notices are used solely by executive chef Tomás Ferreira, dietitian Amara Nwosu, and on-site kitchen leads to plan safe recipe rotations, prevent ingredient cross-contact, and prepare appropriate daily alternatives. These notes are stored in secure operational files, accessible only to authorized kitchen supervisors, and are retained only for the active duration of the relevant service contract.',
	'privacy_c3_h' => 'How do we secure and retain business records?',
	'privacy_c3_b' => 'Mahora Foods maintains administrative and operational records on protected systems with controlled access limited to designated management personnel. Financial and invoicing records are archived in compliance with standard commercial accounting requirements before being securely purged. Operational facility data and contract documentation are maintained during the term of our service agreement and for ninety days following contract termination to complete final account settlements. If you have questions regarding the information we hold for your workplace, you may contact our administrative office at hello@mahorafoods.example or by telephone at +1 (555) 014-0162.',
	'pv_c' => 'Write to hello@mahorafoods.example to see, correct or delete what we hold.',
